      "url": "https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/CONCORDENVIRO_07082026213557_Q1_FY27_Call_Invite_-_Merged_File.pdf",
      "text": "Concord Enviro Systems Limited 101, HDIL Towers, Anant Kanekar Marg, Bandra East, Mumbai 400051, India. Tel: +91 22-6704 9000 Fax: +91 22-6704 9010 Email: cs@concordenviro.in Website: www.concordenviro.in CIN: L45209MH1999PLC120599 August 07th , 2026 To, National Stock Exchange of India Limited Exchange Plaza, C-1, Block G Bandra Kurla Complex Bandra (E), Mumbai – 400 051 BSE Limited Phiroze Jeejeebhoy Towers Dalal Street, Mumbai – 400 001 Symbol: CEWATER Scrip Code: 544315 Dear Sir/ Madam, Sub.: Disclosure under Regulation 30 read with Schedule III of Securities and Exchange Board of India (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulation, 2015 (“Listing Regulations”) – Schedule of Conference Call Pursuant to the provisions of Regulation 30 read with Schedule III of Listing Regulations we wish to inform you that the Company is organising a Conference Call at 10.00 a.m. (IST) on Wednesday, August 12th , 2026 to discuss the Financial Results for the quarter ended June 30th, 2026 to be approved by the Board at its meeting scheduled to be held on August 11th, 2026. Please note that the details of the Conference Call are enclosed herewith. This intimation is being made for your information and records. For Concord Enviro Systems Limited Prerak Goel Executive Director DIN: 00348563 Place: Mumbai Concord Enviro Systems Ltd Earnings Conference Call | Q1 FY27 Concord Enviro Systems Ltd. Q1 FY27 results: 11th August 2026 Earnings Conference call on 12th August 2026 at 10:00 AM IST Mumbai, India – 07th August 2026 – Concord Enviro Systems Ltd., a tech enabled global player in water and wastewater management , will announce Q1 FY27 results on 11th August 2026. Following the announcement, the Company will host an Earnings Conference Call on 12th August 2026 at 10:00 AM IST. Conference Call Details Date 12th August 2026 Time 10:00 AM IST Primary Number +91 22 6280 1107 / +91 22 7115 8008 International Toll-Free Numbers USA - 18667462133 UK - 08081011573 Singapore - 8001012045 Hong Kong - 800964448 Pre-Registration Facility (Express Join with DiamondPassTM to avoid long queue and save time) Click here to pre-register for the call and dial in directly without waiting for the operator. Management Representation from Concord Enviro Systems Ltd. • Mr. Prayas Goel, Chairman & Managing Director • Mr. Prerak Goel, Executive Director • Mr. Abhijit Ghalke – Head Strategy and M&A About Concord Enviro Systems Ltd. Concord Enviro Systems Limited, established in July 1999 and headquartered in Mumbai, is a global provider of water and wastewater treatment solutions. The company specializes in zero -liquid discharge (ZLD) technology, offering comprehensive services from design and manufacturing to installation, operation, maintenance, and digitalization, including IoT-based solutions. It has an in-house R&D team, and a portfolio of patents, which continuously innovates to deliver advanced, sustainable technologies . The company operates in the manufacturing facilities in Vasai, India, and Sharjah, UAE. Concord Enviro serves a diverse clientele across industries such as pharmaceuticals, chemicals, food and beverage, defense, automotive, steel, and textiles. For more details, please visit www.concordenviro.in For details please contact: Concord Enviro Systems Ltd. Soumya Agrawal Investor Relations E: ir@concordenviro.in Ernst & Young (EY LLP) Kanav Khanna / Mahalakshmi Venkatachalam / Salman Mohammed Shiras P: +91-9910036240 E:kanav.khanna@in.ey.com mahalakshmi.venkatachalam@ey.com salman.shiras@in.ey.com www.concordenviro.in / NSE: CEWATER | BSE: 544315 | ISIN: INE037Z01029 | CIN: L45209MH1999PLC120599 | SECTOR: WASTE MANAGEMENT",
