rovement such as widening and strengthening to Danagadi-Bangarkata road from 0/000 km to 27/040 km (except from 3/500 km to 4/500 km, from 7/000 km to 7/890 km, from 10/740 km to 12/007 km, from 16/960 km to 18/444 km and from 20/448 km to 20/627 km) in the district of Jajpur under State Plan” Dear Sir, | am pleased to inform you that your offer against the referred NIB for execution of the captioned work amounting to Rs.19,78,77,668.00 (Rupees Ninteen Crore Seventy Eight Lakh Seventy Seven Thousand Six Hundred Sixty Eight) only (exclusive of applicable GST) being 28.00% less than the corresponding estimated cost of Rs.27,48,30,095.00 put to bid subject to verification of documents attached to the Bid submitted online. You are requested to revalidate the Bid till Drawal of Agreement. You are further requested to submit the below mentioned documents in original for the purpose of verification and attend this office within the time stipulation for approval of the Construction Programme with Milestone by the Superintending Engineer and signing the Py Agreement. | Valid Registration Certificate in original GSTIN in original PAN Card in original All uploaded credentials in original Work Programn;e In addition, you are also requested to fumish the Initial Security Deposit with Additional Performance Security Deposit amounting to Rs.91,02,373.00 (Rupees Ninty One Lakh Two Thousand Three Hundred Seventy Three) only for unbalanced bids in shape of NSC/Post Office Savings Bank Account/Post Office Time Deposit Account/KVP/ /Bank Guarantee/e-Bank Guarantee from any Scheduled Bank duly pledged in favour of the Superintending Engineer, Panikoili (R & B)) Division, Panikoili counter guaranteed by its local Branch at Bhubaneswar for conclusion of P4y Agreement. Be it stated here that the amount so arrived have been determined without considering the EMD submitted online. The Additional Performance security shall be treated as part of the Performance Security Deposit and shall be released after completion of the Defects Liability Period. These documents must reach the office of the undersigned within 7 (seven) days after the receipt of this Letter of Acceptance. Failure to comply with these conditions by you within the time stipulation shall entail the Department to take recourse to such other action as deemed appropriate including annulment of the contract award. Your attention is invited to Works Department Office Memorandum No.14402 Dt.06.10.2017, wherein it has been explicitly mentioned that in the event of failure to furnish the Performance Security and Additional Performance Security in the prescribed mode within the time stipulation of seven days and to sign the Agreement, the Tender Inviting Authority reserves the right to move to the Registering Authority to cancel your empanelment as Registered Contractor and /or suspend /prohibit /debar /blacklist you from participating in bidding for any Government contract of the State for a minimum period of one hundred eighty days. As per Works Department Office Memorandum No.12366 Dt. 08.11.2013, You are requested to submit the Construction Programme with Milestone basing on the financial achievement so as to complete the work within the intended date of completion for approval by the Superintending Engineer, failing which Agreement shall not be drawn and in the event of failure to achieve the milestone action in conformity with Clause 2 (a) of the P4 Agreeme;ﬂ shall be imposed. The work should throughout the stipulated period of contract, be progressed with all due diligence so as to ensure completion by the intended date of completion confirming to the text of the Works Department Circular No.24716 Dt.24.12.2005. The sample of materials used for the work should be got approved by the competent authority prior to execution. In conformity with Works Department, Odisha Letter No. 3606 Dt.25.03.2022, the Contractor shall have to produce mandatorily the purchase invoices of all prime materials along with the R/A/ Final bill for payment of the execution. Works Department Lr. No. 3251 Dt.20.02.2024 stipulates that the materials should be tested at different stages of construction, in the designated Government Quality Control Laboratory (RD&QP Laboratory) at your absolute cost and the test results should be accompanied with the RA/ Final bill. Substantial still photographs and / or Video recording shall be done by you at your exclusive cost prior to execution, during execution, and after completion of the work as per the direction of the Engineer-in-Charge and the C.Ds./Print Outs thereof should be accompanied by the R/A bills and Final bill. At no point of time, the expenditure shall exceed the allotment for the work. Before drawal of Agreement, you have to unequivocally undertake that, you do hereby foreclose your right to claim any financial compensation whatsoever be the nomenclature on account of any profit or advantage from Government, which you will not derive in consequence of non execution of work, if the work is curtailed or stopped at any stage due to want of funds. The Undertaking will form part of the Agreement. The rates/ prices incorporated in the approved Bid are inclusive of Labour Cess, Royalty, Additional Charges, DMF and EMF on Royalty. These rates/prices are firm till completion of the work and shall not be subject to Price Adjustment under whatsoever ground unless otherwise explicity mentioned. The Labour License in original should be produced before the undersigned immediately for verification. On no account, whole or any part of the contract work shall be sublet / off loaded to surrogated executants or transfer be made by execution of a deed of Power of Attorney without prior written approval of the Competent Authority of the Department. THIS MAY PLEASE BE TREATED AS EXTREMELY URGENT. Yours faithfully Moy Superintending Engineer / ”&ﬁi Panikoili (R & B) Division Memo No. 610/ Dated 05/051 296, ¢ Copy submitted to the Engineer-in-Chief (Civil) Roads-| Odisha, Bhubaneswar for favour of kind information vide your good office Ltr No.23655 Dt.02.07.2026 M /é.&' Superintending Engineer B 2% Panikolli (R & B) Division Memo No. 6165 . Dated 5;108/9325 Copy submitted to the Chief Engineer, Cuttack (R&B) Circle, Cuttack for favour of kind information and-necessary action. [ Superintending Engineer % Panikoili (R & B) Division",
