      "text": "Kuvempunagar, Mysuru Nikhil Plaza, 1310 & 1333, Gaganachumbi Double Rd, Block K, G & H Block, Kuvempu Nagara, Mysuru-570 023, Karnataka, India Hyderabad 2nd ﬂoor, IMAGE Incubation centre, Software Technology Parks of India, Divyasree solitaire, Plot No. 14 & 15, Software Units layout, HITEC City, Madhapur, Hyderabad - 500081, Telangana, India Noida Plot no. A 42/6, Suite No.401, 4th Floor, Sector - 62, Noida – 201301, Uttar Pradesh, India Page | 1 EXCELSOFT TECHNOLOGIES LIMITED Formerly known as Excelsoft Technologies Private Limited. CIN: L72900KA2000PLC027256 1-B , Hotagalli Industrial Area, Mysuru - 570 018, Karnataka, India 0821-4002200 compliance.officer@excelsoftcorp.com www.excelsoftcorp.com August 09, 2026 To The Listing Department, BSE Limited. Phiroze Jeejeebhoy Towers, Dalal Street, Mumbai – 400001, Maharashtra, India. Scrip Code: 544617 To The Listing Department, National Stock Exchange of India Limited. Exchange Plaza, Bandra Kurla Complex, Bandra (East), Mumbai – 400051, Maharashtra, India. Scrip Symbol: EXCELSOFT ISIN: INE606N01019 Subject: Intimation under Regulation 30 and 47 of SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015 – Newspaper Advertisement of the Financial results for the 1 st (First) quarter ended June 30, 2026 D ear Sir/Madam, P ursuant to Regulation 30 and 47 of the SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations , 2015 (“SEBI Listing Regulations”), please find enclosed the newspaper extract s of the Un -Audited Financial Results of the Company for the 1st (First) quarter ended June 30, 2026, approved by the Board of Directors at its meeting held on August 07, 2026 and published on the following newspapers on August 09, 2026. 1. Financial Express (in English) and 2. Vijaykarnataka (in Kannada). T he above information is also available on the website of the Company at https://www.excelsoftcorp.com/investors/ W e request you to kindly take the above on record. T hanking You, For