      "url": "https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ZENTEC_10082026200818_Receipt_of_Order_Signed.pdf",
      "text": "August 10, 2026 To, Listing Department National Stock Exchange of India Limited Exchange Plaza, C-1, Block G, Bandra Kurla Complex, Bandra (E), Mumbai – 400 051 Symbol: ZENTEC To, Dept. of Corp. Services BSE Limited Phiroze Jeejeebhoy Towers Dalal Street Mumbai400 001 Scrip Code: 533339 Dear Sir/Madam, Sub: Intimation of receipt of order from Ministry of Defence, Government of India Pursuant to Regulation 30 of the Securities and Exchange Board of India (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015 (“SEBI Listing Regulations”), we are pleased to inform you that the Company has received an order amounting to ₹ 295 crores (including GST), for supply of Simulators from Ministry of Defence, Government of India. The detailed disclosure as required under Regulation 30 of SEBI Listing Regulations read with SEBI Master Circular No. SEBI/HO/CFD/PoD2/CIR/P/0155 dated November 11, 2024 is enclosed herewith as ‘Annexure I’. This is for your kind information and records. Thanking you Yours faithfully, For Zen Technologies Limited Sourav Dhar Company Secretary & Compliance Officer Annexure I Details required under the S ecurities and Exchange Board of India (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015 read with SEBI Master Circular No. SEBI/HO/CFD/PoD2/ CIR/P/0155 dated November 11, 2024 S.No Particulars Details 1) Name of the entity awarding the order(s)/ contract(s) Ministry of Defence, Government of India. 2) Significant terms and conditions of order(s)/ contract(s) awarded in brief The order is from Ministry of Defence, Government of India relating to supply of Simulators. 3) Whether order(s) / contract(s) have been awarded by domestic/ international entity Domestic Entity - Ministry of Defence, Government of India 4) Nature of order(s) / contract(s) Supply of Simulators. 5) Whether domestic or international Domestic 6) Time period by which the order(s)/ contract(s) is to be executed The order will be executed within a year 7) Broad consideration or size of the order(s)/ contract(s) Total aggregate value of ₹ 295 crores (including GST) 8) Whether the promoter/ promoter group / group companies have any interest in the entity that awarded the order(s) / contract(s) ? if yes, nature of interest and details thereof No 9) Whether the order(s)/contract(s) would fall within related party transactions ? If yes, whether the same is done at “arm’s length” No",
