      "text": "August 10, 2026 BSE Limited Phiroze Jeejeebhoy Towers, Dalal Street, Fort, Mumbai – 400 001 Scrip Code: 506414 National Stock Exchange of India Limited Exchange Plaza, Plot No. C/1, G Block, Bandra - Kurla Complex, Bandra (East), Mumbai 400 051 Trading Symbol: FERMENTA Sir, Ref: Code No.: 506414 Subject: Intimation of investor(s) meeting. Pursuant to Regulation 30 of SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements), Regulations 2015, we request you to note that the Company, through its ofÞcials, will be participating in meeting(s) with investor(s), details of which are as below: Date Type of meeting Mode Location August 17, 2026 One-to-one meeting Physical Mumbai This is to further inform that the relevant Press Releases and Investor Presentations proposed to be discussed with investor(s) in above interaction(s) are as available on the website of the Company - www.fermentabiotech.com and on BSE Limited’s website - www.bseindia.com, and no unpublished price sensitive information (UPSI) is intended to be discussed during the interaction(s). Kindly note that changes may happen due to exigencies on the part of the Company/investor(s). Thanking you, Yours faithfully, for FERMENTA BIOTECH LIMITED Varadvinayak Khambete Company Secretary & Head – Legal Membership No. A33861",
