      "text": "Coforge Limited Registered office: www.coforge.com Special Economic Zone, Plot No. TZ -2& 2A Plot No. 13, Udyog Vihar, Phase-IV, Sector-18, Secretarial@coforge.com Sector - Tech Zone, Greater Noida (UP) - 201308, India Palam Road, Gurugram - 122015, Haryana, India T: +91 120 4592300 | F: +91 120 4592 301 T: 0124-4627837 CIN: L72100HR1992PLC128382 August 10, 2026 The Manager, Department of Corporate Services BSE Limited Floor 25, P.J. Towers, Dalal Street, Mumbai – 400 001 BSE Scrip code – 532541 Equity ISIN INE591G01025 The General Manager, Department of Corporate Services The National Stock Exchange of India Limited Exchange Plaza, Plot No. C/1, G Block, Bandra Kurla Complex, Bandra, Mumbai – 400 051 NSE Symbol – COFORGE Subject: Intimation under SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015, as amended (“SEBI Listing Regulations”) Pursuant to Regulation 30 of the SEBI Listing Regulations, we wish to inform you that the Company is participating in one-on-one / group investor meeting between August 13 and August 20. We request you to take the above on record and the same be treated as compliance under the applicable provisions of the SEBI Listing Regulations. Note: Please note that the above details are subject to change. Changes may happen due to exigencies on the part of investors or the Company. Thanking you, Yours faithfully, For Coforge Limited Barkha Sharma Company Secretary & Compliance Officer",
